          "title": "You'll want to know: پھنسنا",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "پھنسنا — phansnā — \"to be trapped; to be stuck\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تین آدمی ایک کمرے میں پھنس گئے۔ tīn ādmī ek kamre meṅ phans gae. Three men were trapped in a room."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): وہ پھنس گیا, voh phans gayā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "is inherited: CDIAL lists the Hindi cousins phā̃snā, \"to ensnare\", and phãsānā under Sanskrit spāśáyati (CDIAL 13814); پھنسنا (phansnā) is to be caught in the snare oneself."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
